## 1. Core Settings (`jeba_core`)

### SiteSettings (Singleton)
**Table:** `products_sitesettings`

| Field | Type | Description |
|-------|------|-------------|
| [id](file:///e:/WebProjects/jebaenterprise/jeba_sales/models.py#67-73) | BigAutoField | Primary key (always 1) |
| `featured_products` | ManyToMany → Product | Hero slider products |
| `logo` | ImageField | Main website logo |
| `favicon` | ImageField | Browser favicon |
| `header_scripts` | TextField | Google Analytics, Pixel codes |
| `footer_scripts` | TextField | Chat widgets, pre-close scripts |
| `bkash_number` | CharField(15) | Payment number |
| `delivery_charge_inside` | Decimal(5,0) | Dhaka delivery ৳60 |
| `delivery_charge_outside` | Decimal(5,0) | Outside Dhaka ৳120 |
| `facebook_page_url` | URLField | Facebook page link |
| `messenger_username` | CharField(50) | Messenger ID |
| `meta_pixel_id` | CharField(50) | Meta Pixel ID |
| `meta_access_token` | TextField | Conversions API token |
| `contact_phone` | CharField(20) | Support phone |
| `contact_email` | EmailField | Support email |
| `contact_address` | TextField | Physical address |
| `business_hours` | CharField(100) | Operating hours |
| `whatsapp_number` | CharField(20) | WhatsApp contact |
| `contact_message_template` | TextField | Bengali message template |
| `call_for_price` | BooleanField | Hide prices globally |
| `maintenance_mode` | BooleanField | Site maintenance toggle |

**Singleton Pattern:** Overrides [save()](file:///e:/WebProjects/jebaenterprise/jeba_sales/models.py#130-144) to force `pk=1`, blocks [delete()](file:///e:/WebProjects/jebaenterprise/jeba_core/models.py#136-138).

