## 2. Inventory & Catalog (`jeba_inventory`)

### Category
**Table:** `products_category`

| Field | Type | Description |
|-------|------|-------------|
| [id](file:///e:/WebProjects/jebaenterprise/jeba_sales/models.py#67-73) | BigAutoField | Primary key |
| [name](file:///e:/WebProjects/jebaenterprise/jeba_inventory/models.py#129-135) | CharField(100) | Category name (unique) |

---

### Tag
**Table:** `jeba_inventory_tag`

| Field | Type | Description |
|-------|------|-------------|
| [id](file:///e:/WebProjects/jebaenterprise/jeba_sales/models.py#67-73) | BigAutoField | Primary key |
| [name](file:///e:/WebProjects/jebaenterprise/jeba_inventory/models.py#129-135) | CharField(50) | Tag name (unique) |
| `slug` | SlugField(50) | URL-safe identifier (auto-generated) |

---

### Product
**Table:** `products_product`

| Field | Type | Description |
|-------|------|-------------|
| [id](file:///e:/WebProjects/jebaenterprise/jeba_sales/models.py#67-73) | BigAutoField | Primary key |
| [name](file:///e:/WebProjects/jebaenterprise/jeba_inventory/models.py#129-135) | CharField(255) | Product name |
| `slug` | SlugField(255) | URL identifier (unique) |
| [short_description](file:///e:/WebProjects/jebaenterprise/jeba_inventory/models.py#135-141) | TextField | Brief summary |
| [description](file:///e:/WebProjects/jebaenterprise/jeba_inventory/models.py#141-147) | TextField | Full HTML description |
| [category](file:///e:/WebProjects/jebaenterprise/jeba_inventory/models.py#348-377) | ForeignKey → Category | Product category |
| `tags` | ManyToMany → Tag | Product tags |
| `buying_cost` | Decimal(10,2) | Cost price |
| `selling_price` | Decimal(10,2) | Regular price |
| `sale_price` | Decimal(10,2) | Discounted price |
| `stock_quantity` | Integer | Inventory count |
| `is_featured` | BooleanField | Show in hero section |
| `is_active` | BooleanField | Published status |
| `created_at` | DateTimeField | Creation timestamp |
| `updated_at` | DateTimeField | Last update |

**AI Content Fields:**
| Field | Type | Description |
|-------|------|-------------|
| `ai_name` | CharField(255) | AI-generated name |
| `ai_short_description` | TextField | AI-generated short desc |
| `ai_description` | TextField | AI-generated full desc |
| `use_ai_content` | BooleanField | Toggle AI vs manual |

**Properties:**
- [display_name()](file:///e:/WebProjects/jebaenterprise/jeba_inventory/models.py#129-135) - Returns AI name if enabled, else manual
- [display_description()](file:///e:/WebProjects/jebaenterprise/jeba_inventory/models.py#141-147) - Returns AI description if enabled
- [discount_percentage](file:///e:/WebProjects/jebaenterprise/jeba_inventory/models.py#202-211) - Calculated sale discount %
- [main_image_obj](file:///e:/WebProjects/jebaenterprise/jeba_inventory/models.py#190-196) - First image with `is_main=True`
- [thumbnail](file:///e:/WebProjects/jebaenterprise/jeba_inventory/models.py#197-201) - URL of main image
- [has_variants](file:///e:/WebProjects/jebaenterprise/jeba_inventory/models.py#212-216) - Boolean if variants exist
- [available_colors](file:///e:/WebProjects/jebaenterprise/jeba_inventory/models.py#217-221) - List of color variant options
- [available_sizes](file:///e:/WebProjects/jebaenterprise/jeba_inventory/models.py#222-226) - List of size variant options

---

### ProductVariant
**Table:** `jeba_inventory_product_variant`

| Field | Type | Description |
|-------|------|-------------|
| [id](file:///e:/WebProjects/jebaenterprise/jeba_sales/models.py#67-73) | BigAutoField | Primary key |
| `product` | ForeignKey → Product | Parent product |
| `variant_type` | CharField(20) | COLOR / SIZE / MATERIAL / BUNDLE |
| [name](file:///e:/WebProjects/jebaenterprise/jeba_inventory/models.py#129-135) | CharField(100) | Variant name (e.g., "Red") |
| `value` | CharField(100) | Display value (e.g., "#FF0000") |
| `price_adjustment` | Decimal(10,2) | + / - from base price |
| `original_price` | Decimal(10,2) | If different from parent |
| `discounted_price` | Decimal(10,2) | Sale price for variant |
| `stock_quantity` | Integer | Variant-specific stock |
| `sku` | CharField(50) | Unique SKU |
| [image](file:///e:/WebProjects/jebaenterprise/jeba_inventory/models.py#190-196) | ImageField | Variant-specific image |
| `is_active` | BooleanField | Enabled status |
| `sort_order` | Integer | Display order |

**Meta:** `unique_together = [['product', 'variant_type', 'name']]`

---

### ProductImage
**Table:** `products_productimage`

| Field | Type | Description |
|-------|------|-------------|
| [id](file:///e:/WebProjects/jebaenterprise/jeba_sales/models.py#67-73) | BigAutoField | Primary key |
| `product` | ForeignKey → Product | Parent product |
| [image](file:///e:/WebProjects/jebaenterprise/jeba_inventory/models.py#190-196) | ImageField | Image file |
| `alt_text` | CharField(255) | Accessibility text |
| `is_main` | BooleanField | Primary display image |
| `sort_order` | Integer | Gallery order |

---

### ProductVariation (Legacy)
**Table:** `products_productvariation`

| Field | Type | Description |
|-------|------|-------------|
| [id](file:///e:/WebProjects/jebaenterprise/jeba_sales/models.py#67-73) | BigAutoField | Primary key |
| `product` | ForeignKey → Product | Parent product |
| [name](file:///e:/WebProjects/jebaenterprise/jeba_inventory/models.py#129-135) | CharField(100) | Variation name |
| `selling_price` | Decimal(10,2) | Variation price |

