## 3. Sales & Orders (`jeba_sales`)

### Sale
**Table:** `products_sale`

| Field | Type | Description |
|-------|------|-------------|
| [id](file:///e:/WebProjects/jebaenterprise/jeba_sales/models.py#67-73) | BigAutoField | Primary key |
| `user` | ForeignKey → User | Optional registered user |
| `customer_name` | CharField(100) | Guest name |
| `access_token` | UUIDField | Guest order access token |
| `phone_number` | CharField(20) | Contact number |
| `shipping_address` | TextField | Delivery address |
| `consignment_id` | Integer | Steadfast consignment ID |
| `tracking_code` | CharField(50) | Steadfast tracking code |
| `payment_method` | CharField(10) | COD / BKASH |
| `transaction_id` | CharField(50) | bKash transaction ID |
| `delivery_charge` | Decimal(6,2) | Shipping cost |
| `status` | CharField(20) | Order status |
| `created_at` | DateTimeField | Order timestamp |
| `manual_subtotal` | Decimal(10,2) | Override for subtotal |
| `manual_total_amount` | Decimal(10,2) | Override for total |

**Status Choices:** PENDING, PROCESSING, SHIPPED, DELIVERED, CANCELLED, RETURNED

**Properties:**
- [invoice_number](file:///e:/WebProjects/jebaenterprise/jeba_sales/models.py#60-66) - Format: `#JEBA-{id+8000}`
- [order_id](file:///e:/WebProjects/jebaenterprise/jeba_sales/models.py#67-73) - Format: `#{id+8000}`
- [subtotal](file:///e:/WebProjects/jebaenterprise/jeba_sales/models.py#85-88) - Manual override or calculated
- [total_amount](file:///e:/WebProjects/jebaenterprise/jeba_sales/models.py#90-93) - Manual override or subtotal + delivery
- [total_profit](file:///e:/WebProjects/jebaenterprise/jeba_sales/models.py#94-98) - Sum of item profits

---

### SaleItem
**Table:** `products_saleitem`

| Field | Type | Description |
|-------|------|-------------|
| [id](file:///e:/WebProjects/jebaenterprise/jeba_sales/models.py#67-73) | BigAutoField | Primary key |
| `sale` | ForeignKey → Sale | Parent order |
| `product` | ForeignKey → Product | Ordered product |
| [variation](file:///e:/WebProjects/jebaenterprise/jeba_inventory/models.py#342-346) | ForeignKey → ProductVariation | Selected variation |
| `quantity` | PositiveInteger | Item count |
| `buying_cost` | Decimal(10,2) | Cost at time of sale |
| `sold_price` | Decimal(10,2) | Price at time of sale |
| `variant_summary` | CharField(255) | "Color: Red, Size: XL" |

**Properties:**
- [total_price](file:///e:/WebProjects/jebaenterprise/jeba_sales/models.py#119-123) - `sold_price * quantity`
- [profit](file:///e:/WebProjects/jebaenterprise/jeba_sales/models.py#124-129) - [(sold_price - buying_cost) * quantity](file:///e:/WebProjects/jebaenterprise/jeba_inventory/models.py#7-34)

---

### Coupon
**Table:** `jeba_sales_coupon`

| Field | Type | Description |
|-------|------|-------------|
| [id](file:///e:/WebProjects/jebaenterprise/jeba_sales/models.py#67-73) | BigAutoField | Primary key |
| `code` | CharField(50) | Coupon code (unique) |
| [discount_amount](file:///e:/WebProjects/jebaenterprise/jeba_inventory/models.py#334-339) | Decimal(10,2) | Flat discount in Taka |
| `min_spend` | Decimal(10,2) | Minimum cart total |
| `active` | BooleanField | Enabled status |

---

## 4. User Accounts (`jeba_accounts`)

### UserProfile
**Table:** `products_userprofile`

| Field | Type | Description |
|-------|------|-------------|
| [id](file:///e:/WebProjects/jebaenterprise/jeba_sales/models.py#67-73) | BigAutoField | Primary key |
| `user` | OneToOneField → User | Django auth user |
| `phone_number` | CharField(20) | Contact number |
| `address` | TextField | Default shipping address |

**Signal:** Auto-creates profile on User creation via `post_save`.

