## 5. Analytics & Events (`jeba_analytics`)

### SearchEvent
**Table:** `products_searchevent`

| Field | Type | Description |
|-------|------|-------------|
| [id](file:///e:/WebProjects/jebaenterprise/jeba_sales/models.py#67-73) | BigAutoField | Primary key |
| `query` | CharField(255) | Search query |
| `user` | ForeignKey → User | Logged-in user |
| `session_id` | CharField(100) | Session identifier |
| `utm_source` | CharField(50) | Traffic source |
| `utm_medium` | CharField(50) | Traffic medium |
| `utm_campaign` | CharField(100) | Campaign name |
| `metadata` | JSONField | IP, location, device info |
| `result_count` | PositiveInteger | Results found |
| `created_at` | DateTimeField | Event timestamp |

---

### ProductEvent
**Table:** `products_productevent`

| Field | Type | Description |
|-------|------|-------------|
| [id](file:///e:/WebProjects/jebaenterprise/jeba_sales/models.py#67-73) | BigAutoField | Primary key |
| `product` | ForeignKey → Product | Viewed product |
| `user` | ForeignKey → User | Viewer (if logged in) |
| `session_id` | CharField(100) | Session identifier |
| `event_type` | CharField(20) | VIEW/CART/PURCHASE/SHARE/CONTACT/CHECKOUT |
| `value_at_event` | Decimal(10,2) | Price when event occurred |
| `stock_status_at_view` | BooleanField | In stock when viewed |
| `utm_source` | CharField(50) | Traffic attribution |
| `utm_medium` | CharField(50) | Traffic medium |
| `utm_campaign` | CharField(100) | Campaign name |
| `time_on_page` | PositiveInteger | Seconds on page |
| `scroll_depth` | PositiveInteger | Max scroll % (0-100) |
| `load_time` | Float | Page load ms |
| `metadata` | JSONField | Additional tech details |
| `created_at` | DateTimeField | Event timestamp |

---

### SessionTrace
**Table:** `jeba_analytics_sessiontrace`

| Field | Type | Description |
|-------|------|-------------|
| [id](file:///e:/WebProjects/jebaenterprise/jeba_sales/models.py#67-73) | BigAutoField | Primary key |
| `session_id` | CharField(100) | Unique session (indexed) |
| [url](file:///e:/WebProjects/jebaenterprise/jeba_blog/models.py#87-89) | CharField(500) | Page URL |
| `ip_address` | GenericIPAddress | Visitor IP |
| `user_agent` | TextField | Browser info |
| `device_type` | CharField(20) | mobile/tablet/desktop |
| `load_time_ms` | Integer | Full page load |
| `ttfb_ms` | Integer | Time to First Byte |
| `max_scroll` | PositiveInteger | Maximum scroll % |
| `is_bounce` | BooleanField | Single-page visit |
| `duration_ms` | PositiveInteger | Session duration |
| `raw_data` | JSONField | Full telemetry blob |
| `created_at` | DateTimeField | Session start |
| `updated_at` | DateTimeField | Last update |

---

### DailyAdSpend
**Table:** `jeba_analytics_adspend`

| Field | Type | Description |
|-------|------|-------------|
| [id](file:///e:/WebProjects/jebaenterprise/jeba_sales/models.py#67-73) | BigAutoField | Primary key |
| `date` | DateField | Spend date (unique) |
| `facebook_spend` | Decimal(10,2) | Facebook ad cost |
| `google_spend` | Decimal(10,2) | Google ad cost |
| `tiktok_spend` | Decimal(10,2) | TikTok/other cost |
| `total_revenue` | Decimal(12,2) | Daily revenue (auto) |
| [total_profit](file:///e:/WebProjects/jebaenterprise/jeba_sales/models.py#94-98) | Decimal(12,2) | Daily profit (auto) |
| `total_orders` | PositiveInteger | Order count (auto) |

**Properties:**
- [total_spend](file:///e:/WebProjects/jebaenterprise/jeba_analytics/models.py#168-171) - Sum of all platform spends
- [net_profit](file:///e:/WebProjects/jebaenterprise/jeba_analytics/models.py#172-176) - `total_profit - total_spend`
- [roas](file:///e:/WebProjects/jebaenterprise/jeba_analytics/models.py#177-183) - Return on Ad Spend ratio

