## 10. AI Builder (`jeba_ai_builder`)

### AIPage
**Table:** `jeba_ai_builder_aipage`

| Field | Type | Description |
|-------|------|-------------|
| [id](file:///e:/WebProjects/jebaenterprise/jeba_sales/models.py#67-73) | BigAutoField | Primary key |
